WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.969
Begin sentences and proper names with capitals. Apply neat spacing and appropriate

00:00:05.969 --> 00:00:07.411
writing conventions consistently.

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:13.683
What can a comma indicate in a long sentence? Answer: A useful small pause or

00:00:13.683 --> 00:00:14.043
separation.

00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:18.451
Correct capitals and spacing in a six-sentence school announcement.

00:00:19.283 --> 00:00:21.865
Why it works: Commas separate units of meaning.
